---
.title = "Salt and hash a password with Argon2",
.date = "2025-08-28",
.author = "ZigCC",
.layout = "section.shtml",
---

This Zig program derives a cryptographic key from a password and salt using the Argon2id password hashing algorithm. It uses [`std.crypto.pwhash.argon2`] to hash a salted password, where the salt is generated using [`std.Io.randomSecure`].

[]($code.siteAsset('src/cryptography/argon2.zig').language('zig'))

[`std.crypto.pwhash.argon2`]: https://ziglang.org/documentation/0.16.0/std/#std.crypto.pwhash.argon2
[`std.Io.randomSecure`]: https://ziglang.org/documentation/0.16.0/std/#std.Io.randomSecure